<title>USA: Fox to introduce five new fall series.</title>
<headline>Fox to introduce five new fall series.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Corp's Fox Broadcasting said Tuesday that it will introduce two new half-hour comedies, three new one-hour dramas and a weekly series of outtakes specials for the fall prime-time lineup.</p>
<p>All the new shows replace shows that were removed, said spokesman Joe Earley.</p>
<p>The shows will join nine returning series, including the X-Files, Melrose Place, Beverly Hills 90210, Party of Five and Millennium, Fox said.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
